---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  page_description: "Legal disclaimers, terms of service, and privacy policy for the Institute of Investing.",
};
---

<Layout title="Legal Disclaimers | Institute of Investing" seo={seo}>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-blue">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Legal & Disclaimers</h1>

    <h2>Educational Purposes Only</h2>
    <p>The content provided on Institute of Investing is for educational and informational purposes only. We do not provide personalized financial, investment, tax, or legal advice.</p>

    <h2>Not Financial Advice</h2>
    <p>We are not certified financial planners or registered investment advisors. All investment strategies and investments involve risk of loss. Nothing contained in this website should be construed as a recommendation to buy or sell any specific securities. You should always conduct your own research or consult with a qualified financial professional before making investment decisions.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>Some of the links on this website (such as those in our Broker Matchmaker or comparison reviews) are affiliate links. This means that if you click on the link and open an account, we may receive a commission at no additional cost to you. This compensation may impact how and where products appear on this site, but it does not influence our objective analysis or educational content.</p>

    <h2>Historical Performance</h2>
    <p>Past performance is no guarantee of future results. Any historical returns, expected returns, or probability projections presented on this website may not reflect actual future performance.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
